## Project Objectives

Development of solid-state battery technology for electric vehicle and grid storage applications, achieving 2x energy density compared to lithium-ion while eliminating fire risk.

### Key Deliverables
1. Solid electrolyte material (proprietary)
2. Cell design and architecture
3. Manufacturing process
4. Pilot production line
5. Automotive customer validation

